# supercronic crontab — runs inside the long-running container.
# Export runs 20 minutes after each fetch (not daily) so the dashboard's
# real freshness matches the ~6-hourly collection cadence documented in
# the UI, rather than lagging up to ~25h behind on a once-daily export.
0 */6 * * * status-quo fetch
20 */6 * * * status-quo export
